---
import Container from '@/components/Container.astro';
---

<section id="regulatory" class="bg-background py-24 md:py-32" data-ps="src/components/home/Regulatory.astro:r1">
  <Container>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-20 items-start" data-ps="src/components/home/Regulatory.astro:r2">
      <div data-ps="src/components/home/Regulatory.astro:r3">
        <div class="reveal inline-block px-3 py-1 border-l-2 border-primary text-[10px] font-mono font-bold tracking-[0.3em] text-primary uppercase mb-6" data-ps="src/components/home/Regulatory.astro:r4">
          FMCSA Regulatory Matrix
        </div>
        <h2 class="reveal text-h2 font-black mb-8 leading-none" data-ps="src/components/home/Regulatory.astro:r5">
          WE EXPLOIT <span class="text-primary" data-ps="src/components/home/Regulatory.astro:64pw6q">FEDERAL VIOLATIONS.</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="reveal reveal-delay-1 text-xl text-muted-foreground mb-12" data-ps="src/components/home/Regulatory.astro:r6">
          Commercial trucking is governed by rigid federal statutes. When carriers prioritize profit over compliance, we utilize these technical failures to establish absolute liability.
        </p>
        
        <div class="reveal reveal-delay-2 space-y-8" data-ps="src/components/home/Regulatory.astro:r7">
          <div class="p-6 bg-surface border-l-4 border-primary" data-ps="src/components/home/Regulatory.astro:r8">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2" data-ps="src/components/home/Regulatory.astro:r9">
              <span class="text-primary font-mono text-xs font-bold" data-ps="src/components/home/Regulatory.astro:r10">49 CFR § 395</span>
              <div class="h-px flex-grow bg-border" data-ps="src/components/home/Regulatory.astro:r11"></div>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-black font-display uppercase mb-3" data-ps="src/components/home/Regulatory.astro:r12">Hours of Service (HOS)</h3>
            <p class="text-muted-foreground text-sm" data-ps="src/components/home/Regulatory.astro:r13">
              Driver fatigue is the leading cause of highway fatalities. We audit ELD data to prove the driver exceeded the 14-hour work limit or failed to take mandatory rest breaks.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-6 bg-surface border-l-4 border-primary" data-ps="src/components/home/Regulatory.astro:r14">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2" data-ps="src/components/home/Regulatory.astro:r15">
              <span class="text-primary font-mono text-xs font-bold" data-ps="src/components/home/Regulatory.astro:r16">49 CFR § 396</span>
              <div class="h-px flex-grow bg-border" data-ps="src/components/home/Regulatory.astro:r17"></div>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-black font-display uppercase mb-3" data-ps="src/components/home/Regulatory.astro:r18">Equipment Maintenance</h3>
            <p class="text-muted-foreground text-sm" data-ps="src/components/home/Regulatory.astro:r19">
              Brake failure, tire blowouts, and lighting malfunctions are rarely "accidental." We expose deferred maintenance and falsified inspection reports.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-6 bg-surface border-l-4 border-primary" data-ps="src/components/home/Regulatory.astro:r20">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2" data-ps="src/components/home/Regulatory.astro:r21">
              <span class="text-primary font-mono text-xs font-bold" data-ps="src/components/home/Regulatory.astro:r22">49 CFR § 382</span>
              <div class="h-px flex-grow bg-border" data-ps="src/components/home/Regulatory.astro:r23"></div>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-black font-display uppercase mb-3" data-ps="src/components/home/Regulatory.astro:r24">Controlled Substance Testing</h3>
            <p class="text-muted-foreground text-sm" data-ps="src/components/home/Regulatory.astro:r25">
              We verify the driver's inclusion in the Drug and Alcohol Clearinghouse and confirm the carrier followed mandatory post-accident testing protocols.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal-right relative" data-ps="src/components/home/Regulatory.astro:r26">
        <div class="aspect-[3/4] border-2 border-border overflow-hidden relative" data-ps="src/components/home/Regulatory.astro:r27">
          <img 
            src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/10020438/pexels-photo-10020438.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1200" 
            alt="Commercial truck regulatory inspection tags" 
            class="h-full w-full object-cover grayscale contrast-125 brightness-50"
            loading="lazy" data-ps="src/components/home/Regulatory.astro:r28" />
          
          <div class="absolute inset-0 p-8 flex flex-col justify-end" data-ps="src/components/home/Regulatory.astro:r29">
            <div class="bg-black/80 backdrop-blur-md p-6 border border-primary/30" data-ps="src/components/home/Regulatory.astro:r30">
              <div class="text-[10px] font-mono text-primary font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-4" data-ps="src/components/home/Regulatory.astro:r31">Evidence Analysis Terminal</div>
              <div class="space-y-3" data-ps="src/components/home/Regulatory.astro:r32">
                <div class="flex justify-between text-[10px] font-mono" data-ps="src/components/home/Regulatory.astro:r33">
                  <span class="text-muted-foreground" data-ps="src/components/home/Regulatory.astro:r34">LOAD_WEIGHT_LIMIT:</span>
                  <span class="text-error" data-ps="src/components/home/Regulatory.astro:r35">EXCEEDED (84.2K)</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex justify-between text-[10px] font-mono" data-ps="src/components/home/Regulatory.astro:r36">
                  <span class="text-muted-foreground" data-ps="src/components/home/Regulatory.astro:r37">TIRE_DEPTH_OFF:</span>
                  <span class="text-error" data-ps="src/components/home/Regulatory.astro:r38">DETECTED (2/32")</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex justify-between text-[10px] font-mono border-t border-border pt-3" data-ps="src/components/home/Regulatory.astro:r39">
                  <span class="text-muted-foreground" data-ps="src/components/home/Regulatory.astro:r40">VIOLATION_CONFIRMED:</span>
                  <span class="text-primary font-bold" data-ps="src/components/home/Regulatory.astro:r41">YES</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="absolute -top-6 -left-6 w-32 h-32 border-t-2 border-l-2 border-primary/50 pointer-events-none hidden lg:block" data-ps="src/components/home/Regulatory.astro:r42"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Container>
</section>
